# Responsive 480w WebP thumbnails: the `.webp` outputs are COMMITTED
# (generate-article.yml encodes + commits each new hero's thumbnail; deploy
# reads them from the checkout and offloads to the CDN). Only the SHA cache
# manifest stays local-only — committing the single-line JSON would create a
# merge conflict on every concurrent article. See generate-image-thumbnails.mjs.
